NNAAMMEE
     wwssccoonnssccttll — get or set wscons state

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     wwssccoonnssccttll [--aann]
     wwssccoonnssccttll [--nn] [--ff _f_i_l_e] _n_a_m_e _._._.
